# Search-only ignore file (ripgrep, fd, and the agents' Grep/Glob tools that use them).
# Git, the build, tests and release tooling do not read this file; it only keeps
# bulk runtime data out of code searches. Search these paths explicitly when needed:
#   rg --no-ignore-dot <pattern> data/      (or: rg -uu ...)
# Files stay readable by path.

# Runtime, history and release data (about 1.3 GB, about 13k files).
/data/
# Crawl and staging runs read by the content file set and maintenance scripts.
/staging/
# Frozen pre-R1 zone app (see docs/v4-v5-retirement-plan.md).
/apps/tulsa-zone/
# Static web assets (images, marks, fonts, llms.txt).
/apps/web/public/
# Screenshot evidence.
/docs/**/*.png
# Large generated knowledge snapshots.
/knowledge/**/*.json
# Lockfile.
/pnpm-lock.yaml
